<title>AUSTRALIA: Large line of Fairfax shares specialled.</title>
<headline>Large line of Fairfax shares specialled.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publishing group John Fairfax Holdings Ltd featured in turnover lists on Friday with a line of 22.75 million shares put through the market after the close.</p>
<p>The line was specialled through Merrill Lynch at a price of A$3.30 per share, the same as Fairfax's closing price on the day. Total volume on the day was 24.03 million.  </p>
<p>The shares represented 2.9 percent of Fairfax's issued capital.</p>
<p>--  Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
